Inside Prop Tent
This dimly lighted tent houses a ragtag collection of outrageous props and wacky devices, including a midget automobile that's garaged in here.

Lying here in a heap is a gorilla suit.

President William Howard Taft is here.

You hear one voice say, "Let's duck in here."

>
You can't go that way.

You can hear muffled voices coming from outside, getting louder and nearer.

>
It's doubtful the figure of President Taft is interested.

Fear motivates you to crouch behind the cardboard character.

From behind the figure of President Taft you hear footsteps enter the tent, a pause, then hushed conversation.

